grimaced. "It got damaged in the explosion." From

59
00:04:11.085 --> 00:04:14.859
the outside the diary appeared to be in pretty good shape. But

60
00:04:14.860 --> 00:04:22.836
as soon as Zann flipped it open, his friends could see that many of the interior pages were ripped, scorched, or missing altogether. "Wow,"

61
00:04:22.837 --> 00:04:29.004
Perda said. "Do you think whatever Boz wanted the king and queen to see is still in there?" "Maybe

62
00:04:29.005 --> 00:04:33.579
I should read it and try to figure that out," Zann said. Gliss

63
