are we supposed to do that?" Perda asked. "It

66
00:04:44.303 --> 00:04:50.015
would take days to reach First City on foot. And we can't use magic, remember?" "Plus

67
00:04:50.016 --> 00:04:56.322
traveling to the castle might not be worth the risk if the diary is damaged," Darb put in. "Zann's

68
